smatches, evidence (evidence can also include per-build statistics).\n\nAlso, I should verify the integrity of the references by cross-checking against the manifest's SHA-256 — a good idea for evidence.\n\nAlso confirm the VCF's contig naming: is it \"20\" or \"chr20\". Don't treat naming alone as evidence — base it on allele matching.\n\nFirst, let's take a look at the VCF header."}}
